<%= @order.event.title.upcase %>

<% if @order.event.state_cancelled? %>
Unfortunately, this event has been cancelled. We are very sorry for any
disappointment or inconvenience this may cause.
<% end %>

<%
  str = <<~TEXT.squish()
    Your payment of #{apphelp_money(@order.amount_owed, currency: @order.event.currency)}
    has been refunded. Depending on your bank, it might take a few days for this to appear
    in your account.
  TEXT
%><%= word_wrap(str, line_width: 78) %>

* <%= I18n.t('views.orders.seats', count: @order.number_of_seats) %> to <%= @order.event.title %>
* <%= evtshelp_datetime(@order.event) %>
* <%= @order.event.location %>

<% if @order.event.state_cancelled? %>
If you have any questions about the cancellation or your refund, please get
in touch:
<% else %>
If you have any questions about your refund, please get in touch:
<% end %>

* E-mail us by replying to this message
* Call us on <%= Hcms.config.contact_tel_human %>
